<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish industrial production data postponed - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish industrial production data postponed - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of Irish industrial production data for May, scheduled for 1100 GMT on Wednesday, has been postponed until the same time on Thursday, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said.</p>
<p>The delay was due to technical problems, a spokesman at the CSO said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
